%% MCA Filing Transaction Lifecycle
%% Status: INFERRED from transaction model + verified statistics
%% Evidence: 3.84cr filings (2021-2025), 86.7% STP rate, 10.6% manual review, 2.2% rejection

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft: User starts filing
    
    Draft --> Validating: Submit for validation
    Validating --> Validated: Pass all checks
    Validating --> Draft: Validation errors
    
    Validated --> DSCSigning: User signs
    DSCSigning --> Validated: Signature failure
    DSCSigning --> FeeCalculation: Signature success
    
    FeeCalculation --> Payment: Fee calculated
    Payment --> FeeCalculation: Payment failure
    Payment --> Submitted: Payment success
    
    Submitted --> STPProcessing: Auto-eligible (86.7%)
    Submitted --> ManualReview: Manual-eligible (10.6%)
    
    STPProcessing --> Approved: Auto-approve
    STPProcessing --> ManualReview: STP rules fail
    
    ManualReview --> Query: Deficiencies found
    ManualReview --> Approved: Manual approve
    ManualReview --> Rejected: Non-compliant (2.2%)
    
    Query --> Resubmission: User responds
    Resubmission --> ManualReview: Re-review
    Resubmission --> Rejected: Timeout/invalid
    
    Approved --> RegistryUpdate: Update MCA registry
    RegistryUpdate --> Completed: Success
    
    Rejected --> [*]: Terminal state
    Completed --> [*]: Terminal state
    
